  charType: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2718c5863d8c65a4aa712d078446307f, type: 2}
  lineTexts:
  - You've really brought me some! That's great!
  - You still look so confused. I bet you're still wondering how you got here and
    what you should do now. Am I right?
  - Have you really lost all your recent memories? You know what? I'll see if anyone
    saw anything, and maybe I'll work out where you came from!
  - You could ask around, too. Even if you want to return home, you'll need to get
    used to forest life for at least a little while. But be careful not to run into
    wolves! Maybe the lake to the east is a good place to start exploring!
